OL,3,GNEWSA'I have a before 9/11 life and an
OL,4,Aafter 9/11 life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaren Rowland assumed, like so many
OL,7,Fothers, that the first plane was an
OL,8,Faccident when she saw it on TV.
OL,10,FAccidents like it had happened in New
OL,11,FYork City before. It must have been
OL,12,Flike when a plane crashed into the
OL,13,FEmpire State Building in 1945.
OL,15,FLeaving her flat, still alarmed by what
OL,16,Fshe saw, she met a neighbour, a doctor
OL,17,Fwho worked at a nearby hospital, St
OL,18,FVincent's. She told him he would have a
OL,19,F"rough day".
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
