OL,3,GNEWSA'I have a before 9/11 life and an
OL,4,Aafter 9/11 life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoments later, having left their
OL,7,Fbuilding at the corner of 7th and 12th
OL,8,FAvenues, she saw the second plane hit
OL,9,Fthe World Trade Center. She realised
OL,10,Fwhat was happening around them was no
OL,11,Faccident.
